# The Titans' places of the Path of Legends: a wary flamenco guitar picking down the Andalusian cadence in D minor over
# a low pad and a heavy, slow kit, something huge somewhere ahead. Played by the Stony Cliff, Open Sky, Lurking Steel,
# Quaking Earth and False Dragon. Original composition for this game (plan 34 · PD4, its second session), in the modern sound.
